  "published": "2026-09-03T16:06:54.563Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.0 — The platform's outbound webhooks become readable and re-firable: client.Webhooks.InfoAsync reads one delivery with every attempt (HTTP status, duration, the body your endpoint answered), ResendAsync re-fires it, and ResendStaticDepositAsync re-fires the newest webhook of a static deposit by the deposit's uuid — the same routes, bodies and refusal codes as the white-label platform. Every webhook now carries X-Webhook-Delivery (WebhookVerifier.DeliveryHeader), the delivery uuid these methods take and a natural idempotency key; keep it when you log a webhook. New ErrorCodes: DeliverySuperseded (a newer event exists for the same object — only the latest may be resent), DeliveryInFlight, ResendTooSoon, NoDeliveries, NotFound. A resend is synchronous here: Queued=true arrives with Status already delivered or failed.",
